    },
    {
      "pos": "n.",
      "zh": "一瞥；扫视（at, into, over）；闪烁"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "He "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "glanced"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " at the dictionary and decided to buy one without hesitation."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "他匆匆看了一下那本字典，立刻决定把它买下来。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "At first "
        },
        {
